of like objects that interact  with each other like it feels natural to  me i understand that like at strange  loop  maybe this is a heretical statement but  like this is a comfortable way for me to  organize  code and i like the idea of sort of you  know classes as being kind of a unit of  modularity  but at the same time i'm really  comfortable with a lot of functional  features i  i like closures i like higher order  functions i like  i really like not having to use classes  for things that aren't stateful  you know like sometimes all you need is  a function right um  and my experience writing dart is that  it's one of the few languages i've used  that feels like it does both of these on  pretty equal footing you know like i've  i've tried f-sharp and i've tried other  languages that sort of try to be  multi-paradigm and they they usually  kind of feel like they're sort of  bolted together you know whereas dart if  i write dart code that doesn't create  any classes  it feels like legit dark code to me and  if i write dart code that has lots of  classes like that's legit dark code too  and that makes it for me kind of a fun  language to use  so if any of that sounds fun to you  i would highly encourage you to check  out dartlang.org  we have lots of fun stuff here we've got  documentation  we've got a language spec specs are nice  people like language specs written by  galad braca  famous language spec guy  we've got some tutorials we've got a  bunch of sample code starts a web  language so the samples run in your  browser which is kind of neat  we've got an entire book which is kind  of cool uh that's you know you can also  just get for free from the site  um and as a language nerd kind of the  coolest thing is we have  try.dartlang.org  which lets you just compile dart code in  your browser and the way it works is our  dart to javascript compiler is written  in dart so we compiled it with itself to  javascript stuck it in a web page and  now you can kind of just try out dart on  the web which is pretty cool  and that's it so i have no idea how i'm  doing on time when am i supposed to be  done  over by four i'm very sorry for whoever  is coming after me  if you have questions and would love to  talk to me would like to talk to me i  would love to talk to you so just come  bug me at any point in time  thank you
 

